    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ob-lātīcĭus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		offero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>freely offered</i> or <i>presented</i> (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">impendium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 7, 9</span></i>
			: aurum, <i>a gratuitous offering of the Senate
				to the emperor</i>, i. q. oblatio, Cod. Th. 6, 2, 5.</div>
